# Default MSBuild arguments applied to all builds.
# Note: dotnet build ignores /m:1 from .rsp files (it enables parallelism by default).
# CI explicitly passes /m:1 as a command-line argument in the build action to enforce serial builds.
# This .rsp serves as documentation and applies when using msbuild.exe or dotnet msbuild directly.
/m:1
/nodeReuse:false
-p:BuildInParallel=false
-p:MSBuildBuildInParallel=false
-p:ProduceReferenceAssembly=false